<ComparePage lang="en" competitor="Calendly" competitorSlug="calendly" title="Shadia AI vs Calendly — Smart WhatsApp scheduling vs booking links | Shadia AI" description="Calendly generates links for clients to book. Shadia AI books directly on WhatsApp with AI. A fundamentally different experience for customer-facing businesses." canonical="https://shadia.ai/en/compare/vs-calendly" ogImage="/og/compare-calendly-en.png" heroHeadline="Shadia AI vs Calendly — AI agent vs booking links" heroSubheadline="Calendly is a link your clients have to open. Shadia is the agent that talks to them, understands what they need and books without them ever leaving WhatsApp." verdictPoints={['Shadia books via WhatsApp; Calendly requires an external link','Shadia has AI that answers questions; Calendly just shows a calendar','Automatic WhatsApp reminders vs email only','Shadia manages the entire operation; Calendly only handles scheduling','Much lower price for full teams']} compareRows={compareRows} detailedText={`<h2>What does Calendly do well?</h2><p>Calendly is excellent for independent professionals and B2B teams that need to coordinate meetings with other professionals. It's the standard tool for booking demos, sales calls and remote team meetings.</p><h2>Why Calendly isn't enough for customer-facing businesses</h2><p>Calendly assumes your customer is willing to open a link, navigate your availability and fill out a form. But the reality for health, beauty, education or direct sales businesses is different: the client is already on WhatsApp and doesn't want to leave.</p><p>Shadia serves clients where they already are. It answers questions, handles objections, presents time slots in the conversation and confirms the appointment — all in the same WhatsApp chat, without friction.</p><h2>The practical difference</h2><p>With Calendly, you send a link. The client may or may not open it. With Shadia, the client types "I want an appointment" to your WhatsApp number and the agent confirms in 3 messages.</p>`} migrationText="If you use Calendly, Shadia can import your appointment types and availability. In under 2 hours, your agent will be booking appointments directly on WhatsApp." faqs={faqs} />
